The implication has been, as with drones, that it's a readiness test of some sort.

00:17.980 --> 00:25.940
If that had been the only thing I had seen and none of the rest of this saga had happened, we wouldn't be talking.

00:25.940 --> 00:43.710
And I go and I have a meeting with Sissy, give them the paper, including the various compartments and programs that they could themselves look into to access the same information that I saw, which is ridiculous that Congress has no access to.

00:43.710 --> 00:56.410
So when I was in USDI, I read the transcripts of Sean Patrick briefing Senator Rubio, Senator Warren and Senator Gillibrand on the results of his investigation in his congressionally tasked investigation.

00:56.450 --> 01:09.530
In those transcripts, which were supposed to be open kimono, here's the truth, Mr. Senator, Mr. Senator, Sean Kirkpatrick absolutely distorted.

