01:28.930 --> 01:30.570
I was in...

01:30.570 --> 01:31.230
I had inside...

01:31.230 --> 01:35.610
I had knowledge into the deception of our government by elements of our intelligence community.

01:42.110 --> 01:43.210
People will be so curious.

01:43.330 --> 01:44.630
So what comes on the fourth page?

01:45.090 --> 01:46.090
Talks through the pages.

01:46.230 --> 01:46.670
