11:43.220 --> 11:44.340
So the idea that it could have.

11:44.340 --> 11:45.180
Been a war game.

11:45.300 --> 11:48.800
Could it have been something, you know, some of these UFOs that had been seen over

11:48.800 --> 11:52.540
