12:15.360 --> 12:20.360
I mean, I don't think it would be the case given the circumstances of how it was located.

12:20.520 --> 12:26.120
The fact that hundreds of people had access to that system, the fact of it's generic labeling.

12:26.120 --> 12:31.120
It wasn't, you know, there was no red flags on that to draw, uh, draw any, uh, draw any

12:31.120 --> 12:34.860
fish to the bait as it were, um, to catch somebody.

12:34.860 --> 12:39.860
And then the process of, of reporting it, you know, there, there's no outcome from that.

12:39.860 --> 12:44.700
Uh, besides apparently making a lot of people pissed off and worried and kind of scared.

12:44.700 --> 12:48.780
Um, so something that we noticed, and I believe it's true reporting, which is that when David

12:48.780 --> 12:54.200
Gresh testified, um, Immaculate Constellation before the world ever knew those words was

12:54.320 --> 12:56.360
searched on Google a ton.

12:56.740 --> 13:02.080
Additionally, over the research and time and sources that we have, um, you know, it has

13:02.080 --> 13:07.700
been confirmed to us under no uncertain terms that that was the name of a program with that

13:07.700 --> 13:08.200
nature.

13:08.200 --> 13:13.700
So if we're looking at it as like a LARP, LARP kind of thing, we get to the point where there's

13:13.700 --> 13:14.660
too many outsides.

13:14.700 --> 13:17.320
There's too many outside confirmation after the fact as well as that.

13:17.320 --> 13:17.820
Yeah.

13:17.820 --> 13:24.120
If that would have been the only thing I had seen and none of the rest of this saga had

13:24.120 --> 13:26.120
happened, we wouldn't be talking.

13:26.120 --> 13:26.780
Totally.

13:27.280 --> 13:33.280
You, you wrote, um, in a paper that was submitted to Congress and we'll go to a lot of, uh,

13:33.280 --> 13:37.040
details in that, but that this was deeply disturbing overall.

13:37.040 --> 13:38.280
Why was it disturbing to you?

13:39.140 --> 13:39.340
Yeah.

13:39.340 --> 13:45.220
So it, as time passed, it became disturbing, um, especially, uh,

13:45.380 --> 13:56.560
after the sort of, um, the process of Grush coming forward, left a wake on the inside

13:56.560 --> 14:02.480
too, uh, people were tracking that weren't even involved, but we're able to see sort of

14:02.480 --> 14:06.660
the distortions on the inside, um, distortions of truth, exactly.

