14:25.600 --> 14:26.940
whistleblower protections.

14:27.560 --> 14:36.680
Um, I think that, that was one of the moments that really, uh, started to convince me that this

14:36.680 --> 14:44.700
was, this was not, um, under, under our, our government's control.

14:44.740 --> 14:46.660
That's our core of why we're talking today.

14:46.700 --> 14:46.960
Yes.

14:46.960 --> 14:47.620
What do you mean?

