that doesn't exist, isn't an issue.

15:06.140 --> 15:14.600
Um, and if it is, does exist and is an issue, but it's secret, uh, apparently our most sensitive

15:14.600 --> 15:16.640
congressional committees are not briefed on this.

15:17.420 --> 15:17.480
Yeah.

15:17.560 --> 15:23.120
I find it at the core disturbing you having, uh, Arrow even asked for whistleblowers to

15:23.120 --> 15:24.060
come forward to them.

15:24.060 --> 15:28.240
Um, uh, having Congress asking for whistleblowers to come under amnesty to come to them.

15:28.340 --> 15:28.640
Yeah.

15:28.640 --> 15:29.960
Something's rotten with that.

15:29.960 --> 15:37.420
And then also at the same time, seeing the, the, the sort of UAP task force and its slow

15:37.420 --> 15:43.540
death, uh, on the inside and the death of the, you know, sort of open exchange of ideas

15:43.540 --> 15:49.010
