which were supposed to be a open kimono.

16:22.290 --> 16:24.370
Uh, here's the truth, Mr.

16:24.470 --> 16:24.610
Senator.

16:24.630 --> 16:32.540
Mr. Senator, uh, Sean Kirkpatrick absolutely distorted downplayed and can't prove it, but

16:32.540 --> 16:37.520
